  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-beyond-limits%252fversion%252f1.5.0-1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UptIcUF.png\" alt=\"Create: 超越极限\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbeyond-limits.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fBeyond_Limits_Wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/u1NPeKE.png\" alt=\"维基\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"LICENSE.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg\" alt=\"许可证: MIT\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Mod Loader-NeoForge-orange.svg\" alt=\"NeoForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fJava_Edition_1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Minecraft-1.21.1-brightgreen.svg\" alt=\"Minecraft 1.21.1\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Create-6.0.8 _Neoforge-yellow.svg\" alt=\"兼容 Create\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/9v8mYEv5p\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-Join Community-5865F2.svg?logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/R1oQrew.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>概述</h2>\n<p><strong>Create: 超越极限</strong> 在 Create 的自动化理念基础上，引入了与世界交互的新方式。从资源处理到灵魂机制，该模组专注于有意义的进度推进，以及奖励规划与实验的系统。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>开发状态</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>v1.5.0 — 喷淋更新：</strong>通过专用组件整合了流体物流与动能电网，新增了流体喷淋器、机械旋转关节和机械旋转联轴器。</li>\n<li><strong>v1.0.0 — NeoForge 迁移更新：</strong>完全迁移至 NeoForge 1.21.1。Forge 1.20.1 的支持现已正式弃用。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>版本要求</h2>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><strong>注意：</strong>为专注于 NeoForge 1.21.1 及最新版本的 Create，Forge 1.20.1 的支持已终止。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Create：</strong>6.0.8+</li>\n<li><strong>依赖项（旧版 v0.9.0 及以下）：</strong>Create、Farmer's Delight 和 GeckoLib。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>安装要求（v1.0.0+）</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">模组加载器</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">必需依赖</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Nl3QxgR.png\" width=\"150\"></a><br><strong>NeoForge (1.21.1)</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YLCftaQ.png\" width=\"150\"></a><br><strong>Create 6.0.8+</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2>备注</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>v1.0.0+（含 v1.5.0）</strong> 需要 NeoForge 1.21.1。旧版（<strong>v0.9.0</strong> 及以下）仍基于 Forge 1.20.1。</li>\n<li>新增的专用方块已集成物品悬停摘要，可在物品栏布局中按住 <strong>[Shift]</strong> 键查看。</li>\n<li>未来更新计划添加更多的进度系统与功能。</li>\n</ul>",
